                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {|X_\bullet|}
            is a direct analog of the ordinary notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+realization"} geometric realization
            of a
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+set"} simplicial set
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topology"} topology
