                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo •
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %mo .
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  {\vert({\vert Sing(X_\bullet) \vert})\vert}  \cong {| d Sing(X_\bullet)_\bullet |}
                  \\,.
          %p
            This also follows from results of (
            %a{:href => "#GaunceLewis82"}> Gaunce Lewis 1982
            ). Thus, as a resolution of
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
