                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {\vert Sing(X_\bullet) \vert}
            has the pleasant property that its geometric realization, as a simplicial
            = succeed "," do
              %em space
            %em set
            (the diagonal of
            = succeed ")." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
