                    %mi B
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{E}G \to \mathbf{B}G
            is presented by the morphism of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+topological+spaces"} simplicial topological spaces
            traditionally denoted
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi W
                  %mi G
                  %mo →
                  %mover
                    %mi W
                    %mo ¯
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} W G \to \overline{W} G
            (see also at
